"test":{"name":"ai-second-supply-ashore","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"supplyAshore","question":"A transport ship off an island, within a move of the supply unit on Blue's beach (linked), carrying two supply units; two Blue grunts inland on the island beyond what supply from the ship reaches. One supply unit stays aboard (the beach is supplied from the water through it: put down, it would be cut off) and the other is put ashore, from where it carries supply inland: within two Blue turns a supply unit stands on the island, one is still aboard, and more of the island is in Blue's supply than the ship alone supplied.","rules":"standard"},
